{\b RVC Realtime}\par
\par
RVC Realtime is a realtime voice changer for Windows. It needs an NVIDIA GPU with a driver that supports CUDA 13.\par
\par
{\b Third-party components included}\par
\par
- NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit 13 runtime libraries, redistributed under the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit EULA (Attachment A). This software contains source code provided by NVIDIA Corporation.\par
- NVIDIA cuDNN 9 runtime libraries, redistributed under the NVIDIA cuDNN Software License Agreement.\par
- ONNX Runtime (MIT License, Microsoft Corporation).\par
- Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable and DirectML (Microsoft redistributable terms).\par
- PortAudio (MIT-style license, Ross Bencina and Phil Burk).\par
- Models exported from RVC WebUI (MIT License), ContentVec (MIT), RMVPE, FCPE (MIT).\par
- Default voice model: PhoenixStormJr / RVC-V2-default-voice (MIT License).\par
- Rust crates under MIT or Apache-2.0 licenses.\par
\par
The full notices are installed as THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt and assets\\voices\\default_v2_40k.LICENSE.txt.\par
